报实销  ⬛客户实报实销或客户安排   ⬜不于报销     ⬜项目总包费用限额： 人民币￥：元\n交通报销说明：\n1、不管是哪一种报销方式，都要以中司控股松山湖总部为起点，客户实际地点为终点，导航单程距离20公里（含）以内，不于报销；\n2、以中司控股松山湖总部为起点，客户实际地点为终点，导航距离20公里以上，自驾车按总里程1.2元/公里报销；乘坐公共交通工具按总里程1元/公里报销，以上都不额外报销高速通行费。\n3、两人以上必须按照地点就近原则自驾一台车，只报销实际自驾车老师；公共交通工具的定义为自驾车以外的所有出行方式。',100,5,111,1,'V~O',0,1,'BAS',1,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,'yes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'yes','longtextarea','all',5,NULL,'yes',NULL,'','','no','#333333','','2023-04-28 03:49:20','2024-03-24 05:32:00','listview','','no','no',0,'yes',NULL,NULL,'no','no','yes',NULL,NULL,'no','no','no','no','yes','yes','no',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(143,3362,'accountid','yes','ld_customform01',2,'73','account_id','客户名称',0,2,'',100,13,307,1,'V~M',0,0,'BAS',1,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,'yes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'yes','reference','all',10,NULL,'yes',NULL,'','','no',NULL,NULL,'2023-04-28 03:49:20','2023-04-28 03:55:05',NULL,NULL,'no','no',0,'no',NULL,NULL,'no','no','yes',NULL,NULL,'yes','no',NULL,'no','yes','no','no',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(143,3363,'cf_3363','yes','ld_customform01scf',2,'5','cf_3363','成立时间',0,2,'',100,14,307,1,'V~O',0,0,'BAS',1,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,'yes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'no','date','all',5,NULL,'yes',NULL,'','','no',NULL,NULL,'2023-04-28 03:49:20','2023-09-06 10:14:03',NULL,NULL,'no','no',0,'yes',NULL,NULL,'no','no','yes',NULL,NULL,'yes','yes',NULL,'no','yes','no','no',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(143,3364,'cf_3364','yes','ld_customform01scf',2,'21','cf_3364','客户地址',0,2,'',100,15,307,1,'V~O',0,0,'BAS',1,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,0,0,'yes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'yes','text','all',5,'text','yes',NULL,'','','no',NULL,NULL,'2023-04-28 03:49:20','2023-04-28 03:55:05',NULL,NULL,'no','no',0,'yes',NULL,NULL,'yes','no','yes',NULL,NULL,'yes','no',NULL,'no','yes','no','no',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(143,3365,'cf_3365','yes','ld_customform01scf',2,'21','cf_3365','主要产品',0,2,'',100,11,448,1,'V~M',0,0,'BAS',1,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL